## Verification Plan

### After Each Phase
- Run `npm run dev` and verify pages load without errors
- Test create/edit/delete operations and verify changes persist in phpMyAdmin
- Test the role-based visibility (admin sees everything, agent sees filtered data, customer sees only their own)

### Manual Verification
- Create a test policy through the form → verify it appears in the list and in phpMyAdmin
- Create a test customer → verify agent assignment works
- Register a claim → verify it links to the correct policy and customer
- Export a CSV report → verify the file downloads and contains correct data
- Search for a policy by number → verify the global search finds it
